-Assisted Wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"EVIDENCE"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Scientific Literature"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Evidence Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Research Methodology"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Health Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Responsible Health Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["BHMS","Clinical Internship","Professional Registration","Wellness / Preventive-Health Exposure","Wellness Consultant","Senior Wellness Consultant","Wellness Program Manager","Corporate/Public-Health Wellness Lead","Wellness Strategy Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is not simply a BHMS graduate providing generic lifestyle advice. It is a healthcare professional with strong wellness assessment, preventive-health, behaviour-change, communication, public-health, program-management, evidence-evaluation and digital-health skills, while maintaining clear professional boundaries between wellness support and clinical diagnosis or treatment."}]}]}